WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,760
Don't worry, I'll bully him with a lot of money.

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,320
I can’t finish my meal and my stomach is full.

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,120
Your Majesty, let's go then

4
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:08,860
Spicy, take a step and stay as a long-term worker

5
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,300
Come back all and let them go

6
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:22,080
This warehouse is yours to take care of

7
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:24,280
From now on, everything I collect every day goes here.

8
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:25,600
You are not afraid that I will tear you apart

9
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:27,880
Do you dare? Dare not?

10
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:34,820
This is the strawberry my dad grew with the seeds you gave me.

11
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,830
Okay, your dad has a few tricks up his sleeve.

12
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:42,490
Take it back and let your dad plant it again

13
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:44,090
If you plant well, there will be rewards

14
00:00:44,090 --> 00:00:47,460
By the way, sir, I want to exchange some salt with you.
